# Allowlist: only what the image needs. Keeps evidence, data, secrets and .git out of the
# build context (multi-GB RAM images in ./evidence would otherwise be sent to the daemon).
*
!pyproject.toml
!app/
!forensics/

# Re-exclude junk inside the allowlisted tree.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.egg-info
